cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TGX Outputs: an automated research-software dashboard for the Department of Translational Genomics"
message: "If you reuse this, please cite it."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Collects what a university department's research software does in the world, from
  public APIs -- GitHub, ecosyste.ms, Bioconductor, Docker Hub, GHCR, Zenodo, OpenAlex,
  the Research Software Directory and SPARQL endpoints -- applies a set of
  data-integrity rules, and publishes the result as a static site with every figure
  traceable to the query and dataset behind it.
authors:
  - given-names: Marvin
    family-names: Martens
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2230-0840"
    affiliation: "Department of Translational Genomics, Maastricht University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TGX-UM/tgx-outputs"
url: "https://tgx-um.github.io/tgx-outputs/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - research software
  - software metrics
  - open science
  - FAIR
